{"id":"5a20f56a269cd8ad","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-ci-almost-covering-family.md","title":"ZFC CI Almost Covering Family","display":"df-zfc-ci-almost-covering-family — ZFC CI Almost Covering Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ci-almost-covering-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ci-almost-covering-family"],"display":"df-zfc-ci-almost-covering-family — ZFC CI Almost Covering Family","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-family.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ci-almost-covering-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ci-almost-covering-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ci-almost-covering-family — ZFC CI Almost Covering Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"545b51e7aa011030\" href=\"?note=545b51e7aa011030\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-family.md\">../batch08/58-df-family.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (ambient set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (family of subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AlmostCoveringFamily}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{AlmostCoveringFamily}_S\\)</span> (canonical binary predicate defined below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AlmostCovers}\">\\(\\operatorname{AlmostCovers}\\)</span> (compatibility predicate defined below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\">\\(\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}almost\\text{-}covering\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{AlmostCoveringFamily}_S(\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land |X\\setminus\\bigcup\\mathcal A|&lt;\\aleph_0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}almost\\text{-}covering\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\operatorname{AlmostCoveringFamily}_S(\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land |X\\setminus\\bigcup\\mathcal A|&lt;\\aleph_0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}almost\\text{-}covering\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\operatorname{AlmostCovers}(\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{AlmostCoveringFamily}_S(\\mathcal A,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}almost\\text{-}covering\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\operatorname{AlmostCovers}(\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{AlmostCoveringFamily}_S(\\mathcal A,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The union of the family covers all but finitely many points of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-family.md","status":"resolved","id":"545b51e7aa011030","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-family.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c